{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>加拿大一個軍事基地起火，四名軍人死亡，39人受傷送院，當中19人傷勢危殆。總理卡尼宣布，全國聯邦建築物下半旗誌哀。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CAN.BASE-0100.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026SLTVkp55RY1792360878.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p>出事的是位於艾伯塔省的韋恩賴特基地。</p><p></p><p>加拿大第一師指揮官拉特蘭指士兵進行實彈演習，並在靶場投擲手榴彈，又指有居民指火災時聽到爆炸聲，但初步檢查未有石油及天然氣設施受損。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CAN.BASE-0100_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026b193jXXRv11792360875.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>艾伯塔省省長戴思敏形容火災嚴重而令人悲痛，影響很多軍方人員。而總理卡尼則表示，聯邦政府正與省政府及地方當局緊密合作，又與戴思敏保持緊密聯繫，並下令聯政府大樓下半旗。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T23:38:41.898522+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":225,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T22:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T03:17:46.878205+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T23:37:36.232656+00:00","content_hash":"db8473c211a50b2c45fecf12939f747807e7d749137d376cd0f2d6094d70efa6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}